{
  "version": 1,
  "kind": "function-plot",
  "title": "TCP 吞吐的平方根模型",
  "description": "调节 RTT 与 MSS，观察经典稳态近似中丢包率增大如何压低吞吐。模型用于尺度推理，不是所有拥塞控制算法的精确预测。",
  "xDomain": [
    0.001,
    0.1
  ],
  "yDomain": [
    0,
    120
  ],
  "xLabel": "丢包概率 p",
  "yLabel": "近似吞吐 (Mbit/s)",
  "samples": 240,
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "rtt",
      "label": "RTT (ms)",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 200,
      "value": 80,
      "step": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "mss",
      "label": "MSS (bytes)",
      "min": 500,
      "max": 1500,
      "value": 1460,
      "step": 100
    }
  ],
  "series": [
    {
      "label": "Reno 风格平方根近似",
      "expression": "(mss*8)/(rtt/1000*sqrt(x))/1000000",
      "color": "#0b7285"
    }
  ],
  "caption": "固定 MSS 时，吞吐与 RTT 及 √p 近似成反比；真实表现还受超时、接收窗口、实现与路径变化影响。",
  "source": {
    "label": "CS 168 congestion control reading",
    "url": "https://textbook.cs168.io/transport/congestion-control.html"
  }
}
